LOCATION:The Burren\, 247 Elm St\, Somerville\, MA 02144
DESCRIPTION:Chick Singer Night (CSN) Boston returns to one of our very favo
 rite rooms\, The Burren Backroom! Saturday\, November 14th at 7:00 PM. Thi
 s all-ages live music showcase will feature a talented line-up of establis
 hed and emerging female artists including CSN Boston Director Jennifer Tru
 esdale\, Co-Director Emma Moreau\, Connecticut based Zully Ramos\, and Bos
 ton area artists Jennifer Tefft\, Jillian Ann and Dovetaile. More informat
 ion on Chick Singer Night Boston plus photos and bios for each of the perf
 ormers can be found at The evening will be hosted by Chick Singer Night Bo
 ston Directors Jennifer Truesdale and Emma Moreau as well as the incredibl
 e CSN Boston House Band\, made up of some of Boston's finest: Juli Finn on
  guitar\, Justin Kolack on bass\, Andrew Beckman on keys\, and Jerry Velon
 a on drums.\nhttps://tickets.24hourmusic.com/eventperformances.asp?evt=774
 \nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/
URL:https://tickets.24hourmusic.com/eventperformances.asp?evt=774
