SUMMARY:Positive Energy
LOCATION:The Burren\, 247 Elm St\, Somerville\, MA 02144
DESCRIPTION:Positive Energy is Richard Curzi on keyboards and vocals\, Jim 
 Wooster on guitar and vocals\, Roger Brown on percussion\, Paul Judge on g
 uitar and vocals\, Rick Dimino on bass\, and Kate Donovan and Roger Read o
 n vocals.These local legends (veterans of local bands including The Marsel
 s\, Courage Brothers\, Radio Musikola\, Blood Mountain Brothers\, and othe
 rs) bring their eclectic collection of original songs by Richard and Jim b
 ased on the amazing lyrics of Roger Brown and John McAlpin\, as well as cr
 eative covers paying musical tribute to iconic artists we've recently lost
 .\nhttps://tickets.24hourmusic.com/eventperformances.asp?evt=1889\nFrom Pu
 shpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/
