DTSTART:20261121T163000Z
DTEND:20261121T183000Z
SUMMARY:The Real School of Music Ensemble Showcase
LOCATION:The Burren\, 247 Elm St\, Somerville\, MA 02144
DESCRIPTION:The Real School of Music in Burlington has been providing music
  experiences for students of all ages and experience levels for over 15 ye
 ars. Our Youth and Adult Ensembles spend four months increasing their skil
 ls and learning songs they love. At the end of each session\, our Student 
 Ensembles take to the stage for their friends & family to showcase all the
 y have learned and experience performing for a crowd. Join us at the Burre
 n in Somerville for an afternoon of amazing music performed by some of our
  youth and adult Fall ensembles! Family and friends can enjoy what student
 s have been working hard on all session long\, while also enjoying a bite 
 to eat! Get ready for a fun and rock-filled experience!\nhttps://tickets.2
 4hourmusic.com/eventperformances.asp?evt=1583\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https:
 //pushpin.city/
URL:https://tickets.24hourmusic.com/eventperformances.asp?evt=1583
END:VEVENT
