SUMMARY:Brian O’Donovan Legacy Series: Annual Holiday Benefit Variety Sho
 w
LOCATION:The Burren\, 247 Elm St\, Somerville\, MA 02144
DESCRIPTION:The Friday Café\, a weekly daytime drop-in program in Harvard 
 Square\, offers a welcoming space where homeless and housed adults can gat
 her and get to know each other. Serving an average of 100 guests a week\, 
 it offers food and coffee\, rest and resources to people living on the mar
 gins—but most importantly\, community. At the Friday Café\, people expe
 riencing a wide variety of life circumstances can relax\, share a meal\, a
 nd talk together as friends.\nhttps://tickets.24hourmusic.com/eventperform
 ances.asp?evt=970\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/
URL:https://tickets.24hourmusic.com/eventperformances.asp?evt=970
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:7b2744d8bf57c1d964f587c6611f0f7485bc18c6@pushpin.city
DTSTAMP:20261114T153123Z
DTSTART:20261202T230000Z
DTEND:20261203T010000Z
SUMMARY:Brian O’Donovan Legacy Series: An Irish Christmas with JOHN DOYLE
 \, CATHIE RYAN & MICK MCAULEY
LOCATION:The Burren\, 247 Elm St\, Somerville\, MA 02144
DESCRIPTION:Times: 6pm\, 8:30pm\nJohn Doyle and Mick McAuley’s nearly tel
 epathic musical connection began in the truly groundbreaking Irish-America
 n band\, Solas. For over thirty-five years\, including multiple studio rec
 ordings\, musical collaborations\, and awards\, Cathie Ryan has been in th
 e vanguard of Irish music. Now\, these three luminaries of Irish music com
 e together to celebrate the Christmas and winter holidays with an evening 
 of exquisite traditional and contemporary songs\, tunes\, and stories fitt
 ing of the season. From familiar carols to special ones that are less well
  known\, as well as new material and their own personal holiday stories\, 
 An Irish Christmas with John Doyle\, Cathie Ryan and Mick McAuley is a bea
 utiful and evocative evening from these three stellar artists.\nhttps://ti
 ckets.24hourmusic.com/eventperformances.asp?evt=1926\nFrom Pushpin Boston:
  https://pushpin.city/
URL:https://tickets.24hourmusic.com/eventperformances.asp?evt=1926
END:VEVENT
