UID:08782d017312964ab94d8a95817a5ab0d386d924@pushpin.city
DTSTAMP:20261114T153123Z
DTSTART:20261205T000000Z
DTEND:20261205T020000Z
SUMMARY:Hilary Hawke Band\, Stash Wyslouch
LOCATION:The Burren\, 247 Elm St\, Somerville\, MA 02144
DESCRIPTION:The Hilary Hawke Band is a fun\, powerhouse quartet featuring g
 uitarist Ross Martin (Jacob Joliff Band\, Matt Flinner Trio)\, fiddler Cam
 ille Howes\, and bassist Myles Sloniker (Jacob Joliff Band) based out of N
 YC. Since forming as a trio in 2022\, the group has built its identity aro
 und improvisation\, original songwriting\, and a shared love of bluegrass 
 and old-time traditions. Hilary and Ross bring over 15 years of shared mus
 ical history across a range of bluegrass projects while also stretching in
 to the world of original music. The band leans into songwriting and improv
 isation\, with performances that are vibrant and engaging. Expect banjo dr
 ive\, soaring fiddle melodies\, intricate guitar work\, tasteful bass line
 s\, rich harmonies\, all grounded in songs that celebrate creativity\, and
  the joy of being live in a room with an audience.\nhttps://tickets.24hour
 music.com/eventperformances.asp?evt=1928\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pus
 hpin.city/
URL:https://tickets.24hourmusic.com/eventperformances.asp?evt=1928
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:8c326355149388381edb364dfb7e128bf5f16868@pushpin.city
DTSTAMP:20261114T153123Z
DTSTART:20261205T180000Z
DTEND:20261205T200000Z
SUMMARY:Jay Bragg Presents: Christmas in New Vaudeville
LOCATION:The Burren\, 247 Elm St\, Somerville\, MA 02144
DESCRIPTION:From Nashville\, Jay Bragg's beloved "Christmas in New Vaudevil
 le" returns to The Burren in Somerville\, MA bringing The Merriest Show On
  Earth — now in its 6th annual year — to his home base of New England.
  Jay\, whose grandparents performed in 1930s vaudeville\, transforms into 
 bandleader King Kazoo from the North Pole\, adorned in his signature brigh
 t red frock coat\, top hat\, brass kazoo\, and a dose of whimsy that only 
 the Wizard of Whimsy can muster — leading The Reindeer Band through a jo
 yful\, theatrical night of original and holiday music built for the whole 
 family. Equal parts vaudeville throwback and Christmas spectacle\, this is
  a holiday show like you've never experienced and will never forget.\nhttp
 s://tickets.24hourmusic.com/eventperformances.asp?evt=1460\nFrom Pushpin B
 oston: https://pushpin.city/
URL:https://tickets.24hourmusic.com/eventperformances.asp?evt=1460
END:VEVENT
